| Redundant Print | ✅ Clean | No `Console.Write*` calls |
| Redundant Assertion | ✅ Clean | No self-comparing or tautological assertions |
| Resource Optimism | ✅ Clean | In-memory resources, no assumed external files |
| Empty Test | ✅ Clean | All tests have executable statements |

